d 'RDISTNN': Distributional nearest-neighbor local estimation
d
d Stata implementation of the DNN (distributional nearest neighbors)
d estimator for conditional Z-estimation.  Provides pointwise inference
d for parameters defined by localized conditional estimating equations,
d exploiting the generalized-U-statistic / L-statistic structure of DNN
d rank weights.
d
d plqr_dnn is experimental: it evaluates localized score moments at a
d supplied theta vector and does not perform local root solving or coefficient
d inference.
d
d Companion to the R package RdistNN and the conditional Z-estimation paper;
d current working-paper citation metadata is maintained in RdistNN.
d
d Author: Jakob Juergens
d
